{
  "//": "What a document's tags are, read and written by `tagsOf`/`withTags` in src/note/tags.ts (test/tags.test.ts), which the server, the page, the CLI and MCP all import; `keys` holds `withKeys` to a block list at column 0, and `hues` pins the default colour a tag nobody registered is drawn in, which every device must agree on.",
  "read": [
    {
      "why": "a flow list",
      "text": "---\ntags: [meeting, pricing]\n---\nbody\n",
      "tags": [
        "meeting",
        "pricing"
      ]
    },
    {
      "why": "a block list, indented",
      "text": "---\ntitle: Q4\ntags:\n  - meeting\n  - pricing\n---\n",
      "tags": [
        "meeting",
        "pricing"
      ]
    },
    {
      "why": "a block list at column 0, as Obsidian writes it",
      "text": "---\ntags:\n- meeting\n- pricing\ntitle: Q4\n---\n",
      "tags": [
        "meeting",
        "pricing"
      ]
    },
    {
      "why": "a string split on commas",
      "text": "---\ntags: meeting, pricing\n---\n",
      "tags": [
        "meeting",
        "pricing"
      ]
    },
    {
      "why": "a string split on blanks",
      "text": "---\ntags: meeting pricing\n---\n",
      "tags": [
        "meeting",
        "pricing"
      ]
    },
    {
      "why": "a quoted string",
      "text": "---\ntags: \"meeting, pricing\"\n---\n",
      "tags": [
        "meeting",
        "pricing"
      ]
    },
    {
      "why": "a leading # is dropped, in a flow list",
      "text": "---\ntags: [#meeting, pricing]\n---\n",
      "tags": [
        "meeting",
        "pricing"
      ]
    },
    {
      "why": "a leading # is dropped, in a block list",
      "text": "---\ntags:\n  - \"#meeting\"\n  - #pricing\n---\n",
      "tags": [
        "meeting",
        "pricing"
      ]
    },
    {
      "why": "case is ignored: the first spelling is kept",
      "text": "---\ntags: [Pricing, pricing, PRICING]\n---\n",
      "tags": [
        "Pricing"
      ]
    },
    {
      "why": "a slash is a character, not a level",
      "text": "---\ntags: [area/design]\n---\n",
      "tags": [
        "area/design"
      ]
    },
    {
      "why": "letters of any script",
      "text": "---\ntags: [réunion, 会議]\n---\n",
      "tags": [
        "réunion",
        "会議"
      ]
    },
    {
      "why": "digits alone are not a tag",
      "text": "---\ntags: [2026, q-2026]\n---\n",
      "tags": [
        "q-2026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "why": "a character a tag cannot hold makes no tag",
      "text": "---\ntags: [a.b, c]\n---\n",
      "tags": [
        "c"
      ]
    },
    {
      "why": "words YAML reads as other things are words",
      "text": "---\ntags: [yes, null, 1e3]\n---\n",
      "tags": [
        "yes",
        "null",
        "1e3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "why": "a quoted entry",
      "text": "---\ntags: [\"meeting\", 'pricing']\n---\n",
      "tags": [
        "meeting",
        "pricing"
      ]
    },
    {
      "why": "a comment after the list",
      "text": "---\ntags: [a, b] # the two\n---\n",
      "tags": [
        "a",
        "b"
      ]
    },
    {
      "why": "a flow list over two lines",
      "text": "---\ntags: [a,\n  b]\n---\n",
      "tags": [
        "a",
        "b"
      ]
    },
    {
      "why": "the singular tag: is not read",
      "text": "---\ntag: meeting\n---\n",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "why": "an inline #tag in the text is not a tag",
      "text": "---\ntitle: x\n---\nA #meeting in prose.\n",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "why": "no frontmatter",
      "text": "#meeting\n",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "why": "an empty key",
      "text": "---\ntags:\ntitle: x\n---\n",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "why": "a board's frontmatter",
      "text": "---\ntitle: Plan\nflow:\n  width: 1200\ntags: [arch]\n---\n\n```erd\n```\n",
      "tags": [
        "arch"
      ]
    },
    {
      "why": "a nested tags: key belongs to another key",
      "text": "---\nflow:\n  tags: [x]\n---\n",
      "tags": []
    }
  ],
  "write": [
    {
      "why": "a new key is a flow list after the last line",
      "text": "---\ntitle: Q4\n---\nbody\n",
      "change": {
        "add": [
          "meeting"
        ]
      },
      "out": "---\ntitle: Q4\ntags: [meeting]\n---\nbody\n"
    },
    {
      "why": "a text with no frontmatter grows one",
      "text": "body\n",
      "change": {
        "add": [
          "meeting"
        ]
      },
      "out": "---\ntags: [meeting]\n---\nbody\n"
    },
    {
      "why": "a board with no frontmatter grows one, a blank line after it",
      "text": "```erd\n```\n",
      "change": {
        "add": [
          "arch"
        ]
      },
      "out": "---\ntags: [arch]\n---\n\n```erd\n```\n",
      "board": true
    },
    {
      "why": "an added tag goes at the end of a flow list",
      "text": "---\ntags: [a, b]\ntitle: x\n---\n",
      "change": {
        "add": [
          "c"
        ]
      },
      "out": "---\ntags: [a, b, c]\ntitle: x\n---\n"
    },
    {
      "why": "a tag already carried, in any case, is no change",
      "text": "---\ntags: [Meeting]\n---\n",
      "change": {
        "add": [
          "meeting"
        ]
      },
      "out": "---\ntags: [Meeting]\n---\n"
    },
    {
      "why": "a string becomes a flow list",
      "text": "---\ntags: a b\n---\n",
      "change": {
        "add": [
          "c"
        ]
      },
      "out": "---\ntags: [a, b, c]\n---\n"
    },
    {
      "why": "a block list stays a block list at its indent",
      "text": "---\ntags:\n    - a\ntitle: x\n---\n",
      "change": {
        "add": [
          "b"
        ]
      },
      "out": "---\ntags:\n    - a\n    - b\ntitle: x\n---\n"
    },
    {
      "why": "a block list at column 0 stays at column 0",
      "text": "---\ntags:\n- a\n- b\ntitle: x\n---\n",
      "change": {
        "add": [
          "c"
        ]
      },
      "out": "---\ntags:\n- a\n- b\n- c\ntitle: x\n---\n"
    },
    {
      "why": "a removal at column 0 leaves no line behind",
      "text": "---\ntags:\n- a\n- b\ntitle: x\n---\n",
      "change": {
        "remove": [
          "a"
        ]
      },
      "out": "---\ntags:\n- b\ntitle: x\n---\n"
    },
    {
      "why": "a removal takes every spelling",
      "text": "---\ntags: [Meeting, b]\n---\n",
      "change": {
        "remove": [
          "MEETING"
        ]
      },
      "out": "---\ntags: [b]\n---\n"
    },
    {
      "why": "the last tag taken off removes the line",
      "text": "---\ntitle: x\ntags: [a]\n---\n",
      "change": {
        "remove": [
          "a"
        ]
      },
      "out": "---\ntitle: x\n---\n"
    },
    {
      "why": "the last tag of a block list at column 0 removes every line",
      "text": "---\ntags:\n- a\ntitle: x\n---\n",
      "change": {
        "remove": [
          "a"
        ]
      },
      "out": "---\ntitle: x\n---\n"
    },
    {
      "why": "a block left empty goes",
      "text": "---\ntags: [a]\n---\nbody\n",
      "change": {
        "remove": [
          "a"
        ]
      },
      "out": "body\n"
    },
    {
